{"id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Essentially Surjective Functor","display":"df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor — ZFC Cat2 Essentially Surjective Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor — ZFC Cat2 Essentially Surjective Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor — ZFC Cat2 Essentially Surjective Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\)</span> (categories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> (functor candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}\">\\(\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}surjective\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land \\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\exists X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),Y)\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(Y,F(X))\\;\\bigl(v\\circ_{\\mathcal D} u=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\land u\\circ_{\\mathcal D} v=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}surjective\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land \\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\exists X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),Y)\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(Y,F(X))\\;\\bigl(v\\circ_{\\mathcal D} u=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\land u\\circ_{\\mathcal D} v=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The isomorphism is categorical; it is not the model-theoretic structure isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}surjective\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land \\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\;\\exists X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),Y)\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal D}(Y,F(X))\\;\\bigl(v\\circ_{\\mathcal D} u=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\land u\\circ_{\\mathcal D} v=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1541,"backlinks":[{"id":"6477de4a04201a72","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}$ (essential-surjectivity predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1578","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","a87b7e1119b63b2c","e637becf421e4e61"]}